      },
      "body": "Stack (4/6), merge in order: [#44851](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/44851) → [#44852](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/44852) → [#44853](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/44853) → [#44854](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/44854) → [#44863](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/44863) → [#44869](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/44869)\n\n## Motivation\n\nA one-step frozen-KV draft still executes an assistant seed forward. The current `<= 1` capture guard skips that forward and leaves it eager.\n\n## Modifications\n\nAllow capture for one draft step while keeping the zero-step/disabled cases excluded. Add a one-step XPU fixture that verifies repeated generation, acceptance statistics, and nonzero draft graph capture.\n\nDepends on #44853. Target weights and verification are unchanged.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nThe new capture regression fails on the old code with `0.0 not greater than 0`; both one-step serving tests pass after the fix. Six greedy prompts match the validated control, including prompts crossing the sliding-window boundary.\n\nGSM8K via `sgl-eval==0.1.3`: 82.5%/200, zero errors, one truncation. This is an accuracy smoke check.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nSame physical Intel Arc Pro B70, TP1 BF16, original target weights; one draft step/two verification tokens, context 8,192, KV capacity 32,768, max running requests 8. Fixed 256-token OpenAI chat workload, two repeats in control–candidate–candidate–control order, with 8/32 requests at concurrency 1/8.\n\n| Concurrency | Eager draft TPOT | Captured draft TPOT | Reduction |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| 1 | 8.812 ms | 6.795 ms | 22.9% |\n| 8 | 11.077 ms | 8.695 ms | 21.5% |\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Pre-commit checks.\n- [x] Serving regression fails before and passes after.\n- [x] Greedy parity and 200-example accuracy smoke.\n- [x] Same-device serving benchmarks.\n- [x] No new configuration required.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #39005273577](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39005273577)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39005273725](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39005273725)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39005273796](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39005273796)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
      "changedFiles": 2,
